R"VG(
# medieval13.vg (H-04; the second pass 2026-10-10): the words a sermon says the everyday with (a law's subject, a contest, a new
# work of art) and the sermon's news when there is none.

# the everyday's words as a sermon says them
med.law.of
  ($e.what=measures) the weights and measures
  ($e.what=tax) the tax
  ($e.what=water) the water
  ($e.what=tolls) the tolls
  ($e.what=curfew) the curfew
  ($e.what=coin) the coinage
  ($e.what=inheritance) inheritance
  ($e.what=drink) drink
  ($e.what=weapons) the carrying of blades
  ($e.what=school) the schools
  ($e.what=census) the count of the people
  ($e.what=calendar) the calendar
  ($e.what=dogs) the dogs
  ($e.what=hours) the hours of work
  ($e.what=noise) noise in the streets
  ($e.what=forests) the forests
  ($e.what=rations) the rations
med.games.of
  ($e.what=race) the race
  ($e.what=wrestling) the wrestling
  ($e.what=archery) the archery
  ($e.what=boats) the boat race
  ($e.what=ball) the ball game
  ($e.what=song) the singing
  ($e.what=horses) the horse race
  ($e.what=chess) the board game
  ($e.what=swimming) the swimming
med.show.of
  ($e.what=play) play
  ($e.what=song) song
  ($e.what=pictures) painting
  ($e.what=film) film
  ($e.what=dance) dance
  ($e.what=poem) poem
  ($e.what=statue) statue

sermon.none
  (has:.told)
  (!has:.told) Nothing has happened this year worth a sermon, which is the best thing a year can do.
  (!has:.told) It has been a quiet year. Be grateful; they are rarer than the loud ones.
  (!has:.told) The {crop} is in, the {herd} are fat, and nobody died who was not old. Remember this year when the bad ones come.
  (!has:.told) I was going to speak about the weather, but the weather has been kind, and I will not complain about kindness.
  (!has:.told) You have all heard the news from {city}. It is not news here, and it will not be.
  (!has:.told) It has been an ordinary {season.now}. I want to talk about ordinary things: the {craft}, the {herd}, the {food} on the table.
  (!has:.told) Nothing has happened, and that is not nothing. Look at the {fruit} on the trees and the children in the street.
)VG"
